### Run each API separately with uvicorn. Default port 8000.
### Payment simulation: first POST returns 201, repeat same request returns replayed=true
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: student-demo-001

{"customer_id":"student-01","amount_paise":1499,"currency":"INR"}

### Rate limiter (run sliding_window_rate_limit:app)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/search?q=backend
X-API-Key: practice-key

### Stock API (run concurrent_stock_orders:app)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"BOOK-001","quantity":2}

###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"BOOK-001","quantity":1}

### Audit log API
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/events
Content-Type: application/json

{"actor":"user-1","event_type":"login","details":"session started"}

###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/events?page=1&size=10&event_type=login

### Job queue API
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{"task":"send_email","payload":{"to":"demo@example.test"}}

### Trigger one job (local practice only)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/worker/run-once
